;; Tool-build variant of javax.tools.ToolProvider (doc/classes/JAVA-FRONTEND-SURVEY.md, "As built:
;; JFS52 (b)", JFS18): read by j2g only, in the world of javac's tool build. The JDK's
;; getSystemJavaCompiler finds javac's JavacTool in the boot layer's jdk.compiler module by
;; reflection; jrt has no module layer, and JavacTool's standard file manager reads through
;; java.nio.file's file systems, which jrt has not. Here it is javac on Arbace's JavaCompiler
;; (overlay/jdk/javac/jdk.compiler's jdk.internal.jrt.javac.SystemCompiler): JavacTool's tasks over
;; javac on Arbace's file manager, for the JDK build's tools that compile through the API
;; (make/langtools/tools/flagsgenerator). Copyright (c) the Arbace authors; Eclipse Public License 1.0.
(in-ns 'javax.tools)

(j2g/variant ToolProvider
  (method ^:public ^:static getSystemJavaCompiler ^JavaCompiler []
    (jdk.internal.jrt.javac.SystemCompiler.)))
